menta-sources (1.0.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release for Debian Menta, forked from mintsources 2.4.4.
  * Manage the official Debian repositories in deb822 format
    (/etc/apt/sources.list.d/debian.sources): mirror, components, suites,
    source code and debug symbols. Support bookworm, trixie, forky and sid.
  * Move official entries found in sources.list into debian.sources, with a
    backup in /var/backups/menta-sources.
  * Remove PPA support, Linux Mint repositories and Ubuntu bases.
  * Replace python3-repolib with a built-in parser for .list and .sources files.
  * Replace aptkit with apt-get, XApp widgets and client side decorations
    with a traditional window layout.

 -- Kerem Söke <keremsoke@gmail.com>  Sun, 04 Oct 2026 01:31:55 -0700
